---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Oxy-Fuel Cutting"
  description="Oxy-fuel cutting from Sector Technology — over 40 years of experience cutting thick carbon steel, including material over 30 inches thick, with Harris, Victor, and Oxweld torches."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Processes"
    title="Oxy-Fuel Cutting"
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Processes' }, { label: 'Oxy-Fuel' }]}
    intro="Decades of experience cutting thick carbon steel, including helping develop the process for cutting material over 30 inches thick."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-steel-700">
      Although oxy-fuel cutting has been around for decades, it remains a very effective process for
      cutting thick carbon steel. Sector Technology has over 40 years of experience with this
      process, including helping to develop the technique for cutting material over 30 inches thick.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-steel-700">
      Sector Technology provides oxy-fuel with straight cutting, linear bevel cutting, and contour
      bevel cutting. We equip our machines with cutting torches from Harris®, Victor®, and Oxweld®.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy-950">Related</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
      <li><a href="/processes/plasma/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">Plasma Cutting</a></li>
      <li><a href="/processes/drilling/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">Drilling</a></li>
      <li><a href="/machines/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">See our machines</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <CtaBand
    title="Cutting thick carbon steel?"
    body="Ask us about oxy-fuel capacity on any Sector machine, including our heavy-duty gantry lines."
  />
</Layout>
